  "details": "Reporting for a friend\n\nReproduction steps:\n\n1. Launch VRC with trackers present\n\n2. Enter FBT calibration\n\n3. Open the QM and use the toggle to disable FBT\n\n4. Sit/stand toggle is now erroneously disabled even though the user is in 3-point mode\n\nHere's a report of a similar/same issue from four years ago which was never fixed: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1241-sitstand-button-disabled-when-disabled-fbt",
